The enrichment fetch is removed, because the node's `with` clause still grants only `aap:caps/response-channel@0.1.0`. The extension was approved, but it is not in the grant the linker enforces, so any component importing `http-client` is rejected. Once the `with` clause is updated to include `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, the fetch can be added back. The node's output is unchanged.

